DATA NOTICE

The neuroimaging data in data/BIDS_preop_postop/ is a subset of the
Brain Tumor Connectomics datasets by Aerts & Marinazzo, released under
CC0 (public domain):

  BTC_preop  – OpenNeuro ds001226 v5.0.0
               doi:10.18112/openneuro.ds001226.v5.0.0

  BTC_postop – OpenNeuro ds002080 v4.0.0
               doi:10.18112/openneuro.ds002080.v4.0.0

Please cite:
  Aerts H et al. eNeuro 2018;5(3):ENEURO.0083-18.2018
  Aerts H et al. Neuroimage 2020;213:116738
  Aerts H & Marinazzo D. Scientific Data 2022
